  "details": "1. Open VRC Quick Launcher and setup a profile (if one doesn't exist).\n\n2. Check the Local instance info for a \"Build & Test\" style instance.\n\n3. Double click the 'Launch' button for the profile.\n\n4. One client successfully launches and the second client stays on a black screen. The second client will also be unable to close via normal means, requiring a forced termination.\n\nThe second client will launch fine if done so after the last one was already done fading into the blue login screen. I'm aware there is an option to create two profiles and use the \"Launch all selected\" option, but it would be neat if the client didn't soft-lock in an unclose-able state.",
